%% RBAC Authorization Model
flowchart LR
subgraph Borrower
B1[Own profile/applications/loans/repayments read]
B2[Create application; update permitted profile]
end
subgraph LoanOfficer
O1[Review applications]
O2[Approve/reject pending applications]
O3[Manage disbursement and repayments]
O4[View active/completed loans and event history]
end
subgraph Administrator
A1[Manage user accounts and roles]
A2[Monitor activity]
end
Policy[Backend Spring Security + ownership checks]
B1-->Policy
B2-->Policy
O1-->Policy
O2-->Policy
O3-->Policy
O4-->Policy
A1-->Policy
A2-->Policy
